---
title: "Cyberpunk creator"
note: "A character of a neon city for Krea 2: one of thirty roles (netrunner, mercenary, street doctor, courier, fixer, corporate agent, nomad, pop idol, ripperdoc …), each with its working clothes and its gear, or street fashion instead; visible chrome, two pieces for the heavily augmented; hair in a neon dye, a gang's colours and sign now and then, a drone or a cyber-rat beside them. It keeps what the picture cannot show (EXPORT:): the role, the gang, the augments, the gear, a mood, a quirk, two skills, a voice, so a reel that casts it from the gallery reads $hero.role and $hero.gang. One seed is one character, from four sides by the grid: the close views show the head, the shoulders, the clothes and the head's chrome, the full-length view the body's chrome, the gear and the companion too; $backdrop puts it in the night city instead of the studio, $view one side only to try characters faster."
tags: [krea, characters, references, cyberpunk]
---
$colour = __characters/creator/colour__
$gender = {woman:4|man:4|nonbinary person}
$fit = {IF $gender is woman: women|{IF $gender is man: men|all}}
$age = {young:4|prime:3|middle-aged:2|old}
$years = {IF $age is young: {19-26}|{IF $age is prime: {27-39}|{IF $age is middle-aged: {40-58}|{59-79}}}}
$origin = __characters/creator/origin__
$build = __characters/creator/build__
$face = __characters/creator/face__
$eyes = __characters/creator/eyes__
$haircolour = {IF $age is old: {silver|white|iron-grey}|{__characters/cyberpunk/dye__:3|__characters/creator/haircolour__:2|$colour}}
$hair = __characters/creator/hair[fit=$fit|all]__
$beard = {IF $gender is man: {__characters/creator/beard__|none:2}|none}
$mark = __characters/creator/mark__
$role = __characters/cyberpunk/role__
# Chrome a head-and-shoulders view can show, and chrome only a full figure shows: a heavy role always has both.
$headchrome = __characters/cyberpunk/implant[where=head]__
$bodychrome = {IF $role.chrome is heavy: __characters/cyberpunk/implant[where=body]__|{__characters/cyberpunk/implant[where=body]__|none}}
$chrome = $headchrome{IF $bodychrome is not none: , $bodychrome|}
$outfit = {$role.wear:3|__characters/cyberpunk/streetwear[fit=$fit|all]__:2}
$gear = $role.gear
$gang = {__characters/cyberpunk/gang__:2|none:3}
$motif = __characters/creator/motif[genre=cyberpunk|all]__
$companion = {__characters/creator/companion[genre=cyberpunk]__|none:3}
$presence = __characters/creator/presence__
$backdrop = {studio:3|city}
# The grid runs every view: one character from four sides. Set $view to one of them to try characters faster.
# The shot comes first and the picture names only what it can show: the close views the head, the shoulders, the clothes, the head's chrome and a sign worn there; the full-length view the body's chrome, the gear and every sign too, and the companion in a sentence of its own.
$view = {portrait|three-quarter|full-length|profile}
$person = a $years-year-old $gender of $origin: $build, $face, $eyes, $hair{IF $beard is not none: , $beard|} and $mark, with {IF $view is full-length: $chrome|$headchrome}; $role in $outfit, their clothes marked by $motif{IF $gang is not none: , wearing the $gang.colours of $gang{IF $gang.where is head: , with $gang.sign|{IF $view is full-length: , with $gang.sign|}}|}
$who = a $years-year-old $gender of $origin: $build, $face, $eyes, $hair{IF $beard is not none: , $beard|} and $mark, with $chrome; $role in $outfit, their clothes marked by $motif{IF $gang is not none: , wearing the $gang.colours of $gang with $gang.sign|}, with $gear{IF $companion is not none: , $companion|}
# What the picture carries beyond its prompt (EXPORT:): a screenplay that casts it reads $hero.who, $hero.role, $hero.gang …
EXPORT:
  who = $who
  age = $years
  $gender
  $role
  gang = $gang
  augments = $chrome
  gear = $gear
  $colour
  mood = __characters/creator/mood__
  quirk = __characters/creator/quirk__
  skills = {2$$__characters/creator/skill[genre=cyberpunk|all]__}
  voice = __characters/creator/voice__
$look = {photo:5|animated:2|anime:3}
$opening = {IF $look is photo: A cinematic photograph, as from a neo-noir science-fiction film|{IF $look is animated: A 3D character render, in the style of a modern animated feature film|An anime character design}}
$shot = {IF $view is portrait: a head-and-shoulders portrait|{IF $view is three-quarter: a head-and-shoulders view|{IF $view is full-length: a full-length view of the whole body, from the top of the head to the shoes,|a strict side profile of the head and shoulders}}}
$stand = They stand straight with the arms relaxed, facing the camera, with $gear, and floor and space around them are in frame.
$pose = {IF $view is portrait: They face the camera.|{IF $view is three-quarter: They are turned three-quarters to the left.|{IF $view is full-length: {IF $companion is not none: $stand With them: $companion.|$stand}|The face is seen exactly from the side, turned 90 degrees to the left, the nose pointing at the left edge of the frame and only one eye visible.}}}
$finish = {IF $look is photo: Shot on an 85mm lens at eye level, true colours with a touch of neon in the highlights.|{IF $look is animated: Stylised proportions, soft subsurface skin.|Clean line art and flat cel shading.}}
$opening: $shot of $person, with $presence. $pose Behind them is {IF $backdrop is studio: a seamless mid-grey studio backdrop|__characters/cyberpunk/city__}, in soft, even light. $finish
@size 832x1216
@grid $view
